Package: DEGinsight
Title: LLM-Assisted Pathway and Mechanism Interpretation of Bulk RNA-seq
    Differential Expression Results
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "omixcore",
           family = "",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "1264284076@qq.com")
Description: Interprets differential gene expression (DEG) results from bulk
    RNA-seq experiments by combining classical enrichment analysis (ORA/GSEA)
    with large language model (LLM) reasoning. DEGinsight builds structured,
    ontology-constrained prompts from enrichment results, queries one or more
    LLMs through a unified OpenAI-compatible backend, validates model outputs
    against controlled vocabularies (GO, KEGG, Reactome) to quantify and
    suppress hallucinations, and integrates multi-model votes into
    evidence-graded mechanistic hypotheses. A reproducible HTML report and
    cost-estimation utilities are included.
